  "instructions": [
    "preheat the oven to 400°f (200°c).",
    "mix lemon juice, dill, garlic, salt, and pepper in a small bowl.",
    "place a mason jar on a baking sheet lined with parchment paper.",
    "add a layer of sea bass to the mason jar.",
    "drizzle the lemon-dill mixture over the sea bass.",
    "add a layer of crushed almonds on top of the sea bass.",
    "sprinkle the flour over the almonds.",
    "repeat the layers two more times, ending with a layer of almonds on top.",
    "drizzle olive oil over the top layer of almonds.",
    "cover the baking sheet with aluminum foil and bake for 12 minutes.",
    "remove the foil and bake for an additional 5 minutes, or until the top is golden brown."
